#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0128 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0128 (SDTMIG 3.2), Condition \"ARMCD not in TA.ARMCD\", Rule \"ARMCD in (SCRNFAIL, NOTASSGN)\". The Check compares upper(ARMCD) with the exemption literals: that case-folding is the RULED idiom (PLAN-port-core-expression-improvements Q1(a), owner 2026-09-22; applied to this rule by CHANGE-arm-upper-alignment.tsv), not a Partially Executable limitation. The limitation is multi-stage Arm allocation (SDTMIG 3.2 DM Assumption 4, cited in rules-src/docs/CDISC/CDISC-CG0128.yaml): a subject who drops out between two allocation processes carries an ARMCD reflecting only the allocations undergone, which need not be a TA arm, and the Check would flag it. This fixture models a single-stage study (one allocation, every arm fully defined in TA), so that clause never arises. ARMCD is a TA arm (PBO, XANHI) or one of the two exemption values -> silent. No blank ARMCD (ARMCD is Req in SDTMIG 3.2 and the sheet text does not decide a null)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-2
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ARMCD    type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM      type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-001 | PBO      | Placebo
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-002 | XANHI    | Xanomeline High
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-003 | SCRNFAIL | Screen Failure
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-004 | NOTASSGN | Not Assigned
---

dataset TA label="Trial Arms"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ARMCD   type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM     type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
col TAETORD type=Num  label="Planned Order of Element within Arm"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TA | PBO   | Placebo         | 1 | SCRN | Screening
CDISCPILOT01 | TA | PBO   | Placebo         | 2 | PBO  | Placebo
CDISCPILOT01 | TA | XANHI | Xanomeline High | 1 | SCRN | Screening
CDISCPILOT01 | TA | XANHI | Xanomeline High | 2 | XANH | Xanomeline High
---
